{"parse": {"title": "“闪烁之夜”万花筒", "pageid": 150054, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div style=\"user-select:none; pointer-events:none; position:relative; z-index:-1;\"></div><div class=\"antique-content\"><div class=\"antique-img\"><div style=\"margin-top:-13%;\"><img alt=\"“闪烁之夜”万花筒\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/eb/Antique-v4a0_antique_icon_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"“闪烁之夜”万花筒\" width=\"700\" height=\"728\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"700\" data-file-height=\"728\" /></div><div style=\"position:absolute;width: 40%;height: 34%;right:20%;top: 76%;text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Signature-501214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6f/Signature-501214.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"292\" height=\"280\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"292\" data-file-height=\"280\" /></div></div><div style=\"max-width:600px; margin: 35px 20px 0 20px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 5px black;\">为庆典拉开序幕的神秘学装置。该装置加装了投影功能，在巡游结束后，可与伙伴们一同回顾这场光怪陆离、变幻无穷的梦境。<br />水晶能够折射出世界的千万个影像，你也曾漫步在其中之一。<div class=\"test-hide hide-m grey-small\" style=\"float:right; margin-top:40px\">编号ID：401002</div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E9.99.84.E5.8A.A0.E5.89.A7.E6.83.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"附加剧情\">附加剧情</span></h2><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\" style=\"transform:translateY(0); gap:20px; position:relative; flex-direction:row-reverse; margin-bottom:0.8em;\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>水晶已经准备好了，接下来用珠宝胶小心地拼合这几块镜面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>您是说……这场属于我们的共同梦境，能通过这颗水晶、这些镜子重新映现？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>可以这么理解，十四行诗小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>水晶能够让自身成为世界的映照，于是我们就可以从不同的侧面，观看其可能折射出的光景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>“可能”？方才的这一夜，究竟是真实还是虚幻的？我还是没有搞明白……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>呵呵……对于一场表演而言，这并不重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我很久没有登上那么大的舞台了……观众席有那么、那么多的人，我差点儿都忘了怎么呼吸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>你唱得……很好。很闪亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>还好我没紧张到忘记歌词，否则真不知道该怎么办啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>噢，这些水晶碎屑真淘气！它们跑得到处都是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>试试这个“亮闪闪尖嘴收集器”吧！X说它一定管用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我想知道，如果旋转这个万花筒，还会产生别的梦境吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>比如，氛围制造机里忽然录满了摇滚乐，或者大卫·鲍伊忽然宣布他统治了世界，哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你们不妨试一试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>这个……给。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>多谢，远旅小姐。这是最后的一步——安装这颗棱镜，然后照进一束柔和的光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>当当！大功告成！谁要当第一个？谁想重温今晚的美梦？谁想转个角度，观看一场新的冒险？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊索尔德：</div><div>噢……冒险，多么迷人……可是剧目的主角呢？那位要站到舞台中央的主演在何处现身？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">远旅：</div><div>*一段如雨声的演奏*</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>噢！维尔汀！我们现在就去找她！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我也很想知道——如果是她的话，是否会在其中窥见什么新的景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>但先别着急，各位。我们还需要等胶水干透。</div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "收藏品"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">“闪烁之夜”万花筒 <small style=\"color: grey\">\"The Glittering Night\" Kaleidoscope</small></span></span>"}}